                                        "entry_id": "ba1b50f3-1c45-3216-b038-2d042367ff9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having an inclination to secrecy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4adb9439-1cc6-49c0-8b6f-041a45968959",
                                                "sense_id": "4aeaa780-7c44-3c91-a01f-de6d1756ef47",
                                                "text": "She's a secretive girl, not giving away much about her life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a374e6cd-f7a5-452d-b1c9-b700590975a5",
                                                "sense_id": "4aeaa780-7c44-3c91-a01f-de6d1756ef47",
                                                "text": "Why are you acting all secretive? What are you hiding?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7d9844f-5a4a-4d2a-b4b5-1dea36a73de9",
                                                "sense_id": "4aeaa780-7c44-3c91-a01f-de6d1756ef47",
                                                "text": "Sitting back on a bench in the sunshine, Tom and I began to catch up with each other while the girls arranged their surprises at the remotest picnic table in the lay-by. Genial lorry drivers, munching wurst high in their cabs, looking down on their secretive toing and froing with interest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
